# Review Personas

When reviewing portfolio pages for content, clarity, or copy changes, test against all of these personas:

## Expert personas
- **Head of Design** — evaluates craft depth, design thinking, leadership signals
- **Head of Product** — evaluates business impact, strategic thinking, measurable outcomes
- **Senior Engineer** — evaluates technical accuracy, feasibility awareness, handoff quality

## Non-expert personas
- **Recruiter** — scanning quickly, needs to understand what you do and your seniority in seconds
- **Non-tech hiring manager** — understands business but not design jargon, needs plain language
- **Novice / "Mum test"** — zero industry knowledge, every term must make sense without context

## How to apply
- Home page and contact must pass all 6 personas (especially novice — no jargon)
- Case study pages must pass expert personas; novice-friendliness is a bonus, not a requirement
- Pillar/value descriptions must pass novice — if a term needs explaining, simplify it
- Stats and metrics must be understandable without reading the case study first
